e teleport locomotion\n* Rich interior details: antiques, art, and classic d\u00e9cor\n* Relaxing experience\u2014no combat, puzzles, or objectives\n\n**Controls**\n\n* Right Thumbstick: Teleport to move\n\nPerfect for anyone who enjoys virtual museum tours, historic houses, art galleries, and calm exploration in VR.\n", "short_description": "VR Museum Tour: Historic Rooms is a relaxed virtual walkthrough. Teleport through beautifully detailed historic rooms, admire classic interiors and paintings, and explore at your own pace.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://alikaanbashan.org/4_vr_privacy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ali Kaan BA\u015eHAN", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.instagram.com/alikaan_1998_/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25975296098750043"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1462186071597991"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2002058357395137"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4313787398898105"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2002058357395137"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1778266800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1462186071597991"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26